wireview-hwmon (1.3) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add support for firmware 1.0.6 config version 2 (96-byte config)
  * wireviewd: read config version from device instead of deriving from FW version
  * wireviewctl: write-config now accepts 96-byte v2 configs

