wireview-hwmon (1.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix config read/write sizes to match firmware struct layout
  * wireviewd: default config read size corrected from 130/131 to 72/74 bytes
  * wireviewctl: write-config now accepts correct config sizes (72/74 bytes)

